        "README.md described v0.2.0 as an implementation phase.",
        "README.md stopped accepted ADR inventory at ADR 0019 although ADR 0020 is accepted.",
        "README.md listed already-implemented v0.2 capabilities as likely next work.",
        "README.md promised future license documentation despite the MIT LICENSE.",
        "SECURITY.md duplicated the Identity and Cross-Module Boundaries heading.",
        "docs/README.md contained visible em-dash mojibake and stale Slice-1-only wording for Issue #54 validation."
      ],
      "affected_files_or_contracts": [
        "README.md",
        "SECURITY.md",
        "CHANGELOG.md",
        "docs/README.md",
        "RELEASE_NOTES_v0.2.0.md",
        "source-distribution documentation inventory"
      ],
      "expected_behavior": "Release-facing documentation accurately describes the current candidate, accepted architecture, license, deferred scope, and publication state.",
      "observed_problem": "Top-level documentation lagged the executable candidate and accepted architecture.",
      "risk_or_consequence": "Readers could mistake implemented capabilities for future work or misunderstand release/license/architecture status.",
